<title>USA: BankAmerica Corp Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>BankAmerica Corp Q3 net rises.</headline>
<text>
<p>SAN FRANCISCO, Oct 16 (Reuter)</p>
<p>		     Sept 30,    1996	    Sept 30,1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $	1.75	    $     1.72</p>
<p> Net			683,000		  704,000</p>
<p>	  Nine MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $	5.38	    $	4.75</p>
<p> Net		    2,126,000		1,960,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers) NOTE:Q3 1996 net includes one-time assessment of $82 million for  SAIF recapitalization. Excluding assessment, net income and EPS were $731 million and $1.88 a share, respectively. Total assets as of Sept 30 were $243.0 billion vs $239.0 billion June 30, 1996 and $230.0 billion on Sept 30, 1995.</p>
</text>
